        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ve barely escaped the chaos that consumed your hometown overnight. The friendly residents of Grimshire, an isolated mountain village, offer you a new home. Restore the cozy old farmhouse, and tend the fields. But beware, a mysterious plague is coming. The community must work together if everyone is to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2238470/extras/bb8b2bc9eb41efa6724fa1365ee6c65e.poster.avif?t=1784731982\" width=600 height=86 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2238470/extras/bb8b2bc9eb41efa6724fa1365ee6c65e.webm?t=1784731982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Feed Them</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep the root cellar stocked, balance the needs of both herbivores and carnivores. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prevent food from rotting away by salting, pickling, drying, and smoking. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cultivate a field of crops, and plant an orchard of fruit and nut trees.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tame wild critters and raise them for a steady supply of eggs, milk, and meat. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forage for seeds, flowers, herbs, nuts, roots and berries.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go fishing in nearby marshes, rivers, and lakes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Be a part of the Community</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather materials and construct village projects to strengthen the community.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Donate specimens for research and discover new methods to increase the odds of survival. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Befriend the adorable villagers of Grimshire. But don't get too attached... It's possible that not everyone will survive.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the World</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive deep in the mines of Grimshire valley, and root out every vein of ore. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience beautiful shifting dynamic seasons and weather. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your home and farm with a variety of furniture, fences, pathing stones, and more! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2238470/extras/e03ae545cbb74fb54344e6ed64a64b44.poster.avif?t=1784731982\" width=500 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2238470/extras/e03ae545cbb74fb54344e6ed64a64b44.webm?t=1784731982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2238470/extras/e03ae545cbb74fb54344e6ed64a64b44.mp4?t=1784731982\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ve barely escaped the chaos that consumed your hometown overnight. The friendly residents of Grimshire, an isolated mountain village, offer you a new home. Restore the cozy old farmhouse, and tend the fields. But beware, a mysterious plague is coming. The community must work together if everyone is to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2238470/extras/bb8b2bc9eb41efa6724fa1365ee6c65e.poster.avif?t=1784731982\" width=600 height=86 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2238470/extras/bb8b2bc9eb41efa6724fa1365ee6c65e.webm?t=1784731982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Feed Them</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep the root cellar stocked, balance the needs of both herbivores and carnivores. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prevent food from rotting away by salting, pickling, drying, and smoking. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cultivate a field of crops, and plant an orchard of fruit and nut trees.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tame wild critters and raise them for a steady supply of eggs, milk, and meat. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forage for seeds, flowers, herbs, nuts, roots and berries.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go fishing in nearby marshes, rivers, and lakes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Be a part of the Community</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather materials and construct village projects to strengthen the community.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Donate specimens for research and discover new methods to increase the odds of survival. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Befriend the adorable villagers of Grimshire. But don't get too attached... It's possible that not everyone will survive.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the World</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive deep in the mines of Grimshire valley, and root out every vein of ore. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience beautiful shifting dynamic seasons and weather. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your home and farm with a variety of furniture, fences, pathing stones, and more! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2238470/extras/e03ae545cbb74fb54344e6ed64a64b44.poster.avif?t=1784731982\" width=500 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2238470/extras/e03ae545cbb74fb54344e6ed64a64b44.webm?t=1784731982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2238470/extras/e03ae545cbb74fb54344e6ed64a64b44.mp4?t=1784731982\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
